      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 11: Folio 4v, left side (Alfa\u0304z\u0323 al-kufr Section)",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">[in red ink] Ve dah\u032ei i\u0304ma\u0304ns\u0131z gitmenin</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>sebebleri yig\u0306irmi yedidir.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Evveli yaramaz i\u02bftik\u0323a\u0304d.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I\u0307kinci z\u0307a\u02bff i\u0304ma\u0304n.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>U\u0308c\u0327u\u0308ncu\u0308 t\u0323ok\u0323uz a\u02bfz\u0307a\u0304da</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>t\u0323og\u0307ruluk\u0323dan c\u0327\u0131k\u0323mak\u0323. Do\u0308rdu\u0308nci</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>gu\u0308na\u0304ha mus\u0323\u0131rr olmak\u0323.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
