      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 11: Folio 4v, left side ('Utterances of Unbelief' Section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Furthermore,</li>\n<li>\n<p>there are 27 causes of falling into unbelief</p>\n</li>\n<li>The first is inadequate conviction.</li>\n<li>The second is weak belief.</li>\n<li>The third is to stray from the&nbsp;</li>\n<li>right [path] by means of the nine organs. The fourth</li>\n<li>is to sin persistently.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
